  "description": "Marshmallow Pop is a bold bubble display font designed to bring joy, warmth, and creativity to every project. Its soft rounded shapes and chunky letterforms create a fun, friendly appearance that’s easy to read and full of personality.\nThis font is ideal for children’s books, birthday invitations, food packaging, toy branding, stickers, T-shirts, mugs, classroom resources, posters, social media graphics, and DIY craft projects.\nWhether you’re designing with Canva, Cricut, Silhouette, Adobe Illustrator, Photoshop, or Procreate, Marshmallow Pop adds a cheerful and eye-catching touch to your work.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Marshmallow Pop is a bold bubble display font designed to bring joy, warmth, and creativity to every project. Its soft rounded shapes and chunky letterforms create a fun, friendly appearance that’s easy to read and full of personality.</p>\n<p>This font is ideal for children’s books, birthday invitations, food packaging, toy branding, stickers, T-shirts, mugs, classroom resources, posters, social media graphics, and DIY craft projects.</p>\n<p>Whether you’re designing with Canva, Cricut, Silhouette, Adobe Illustrator, Photoshop, or Procreate, Marshmallow Pop adds a cheerful and eye-catching touch to your work.</p>",
